"value":3,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5266550","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4183920-1847286114041390","game_id":"steam-4183920","kind":"update","title":"Demo v1.5 Update!🎃","summary":"Thanks for playing the Pumpkin Is Yummy!? demo!Update 1.5 brings more changes to make your time on the farm even more fun. Here are the details!\\We've reminded our adorable Bau not to leave their hat's propeller sticking out when they go inside.Gomi, the farm owner, now waits a little longer before introducing themselves. (They were talking over the pumpkin!)\\When everything under 'Today's Items' is sold out, the pawn shop now shows 'Sold Out' outside, so you can tell without opening the menu.\\O","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T07:55:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041390","verified_at":"2026-10-25T08:33:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4183920-1847286114036287","game_id":"steam-4183920","kind":"update","title":"Demo v1.4 Update!🎃","summary":"Thank you for playing the 'Pumpkin Is Yummy!?' Demo!We've made more improvements for version 1.4 to make life on the farm even more fun. Here's what's changed!\\Characters now have something to say from time to time!They might share a helpful tip for life on the farm or even give you a gift, so keep an eye out!\\You can now click on a building you've placed to view its details!You can now collect water from the 'Crown Fountain'!\\Improved how popups appear when you select creatures or props in the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:57:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036287","verified_at":"2026-10-23T17:54:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4183920-1847286114032859","game_id":"steam-4183920","kind":"update","title":"Demo v1.3 Update!🎃","summary":"Thank you for playing the Pumpkin Is Yummy!? demo!We've been working on more improvements for version 1.3. Here's what's changed!\\You can now see how much EXP a pumpkin gains when a farm resident takes care of it.\\We've tidied up how buildings look during construction. (The construction sites are still a mess, though.)Added descriptions of how the well and storage work. (You probably know already.)Fixed the incorrectly placed top and bottom sections of the fruit tree fences.\\You can now pan far ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:18:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032859","verified_at":"2026-10-22T15:02:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4183920-1847286114028724","game_id":"steam-4183920","kind":"update","title":"Demo v1.2 Update!🎃","summary":"Thanks for playing the Pumpkin Is Yummy!? demo!Following yesterday's update, version 1.2 brings more changes based on your feedback.\\We've made it easier to use the action settings that open when you click a character.Click an icon and it will follow your cursor. No need to drag it.You can set or clear actions with a click, too.The UI now stays the same size across all view modes.This also applies to Manage Mode, making the UI easier to read.When you start a new game, notifications now mark the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:38:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028724","verified_at":"2026-10-21T17:14:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4183920-1846651706695321","game_id":"steam-4183920","kind":"update","title":"Demo v1.1 Update!🎃","summary":"Thank you for playing the Pumpkin Is Yummy!? demo!Today, we're sharing the additions and fixes in version 1.1 to make your experience even better!\\We've added \\ so you can get a closer look at your characters' daily lives.Click a character to open their action window, then click their name to zoom in to 2x and have the camera follow them.Click their name again or press ESC to exit \\.You can't scroll the camera while in \\!If you've lowered the farm to the bottom of the screen, turning on \\ will b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695321","verified_at":"2026-10-21T03:57:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4183920-1846651706691777","game_id":"steam-4183920","kind":"announcement","title":"The Pumpkins Brought a Demo to Steam Next Fest! 🎃","summary":"The pumpkins heard about Steam Next Fest…and somehow showed up with a demo. 🎃🤣The Pumpkin Is Yummy!? Demo is now live!Our little pumpkin farm is still growing, so we’ll be updating and polishing the demo every day during the event. 🌱 You may spot fixes, tweaks, and little changes here and there as we keep working on it.So come visit the farm, meet the pumpkins, and give the demo a try!And please keep sending us your thoughts and feedback. 👀 What did you enjoy? What felt a little strange? What wo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:26:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691777","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4183920-1844751498227601","game_id":"steam-4183920","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to the Pumpkin Farm! 🎃🌱","summary":"Hello, pumpkin friends!Welco